Ok, sorry *my* mistake. There *should* be a bunch of alock.* files.
Those are save files for individual levels. If there aren't more than
one (assuming you decended to at least level 2) or any of them is size
zero, then you're foobarred. Otherwise, you did the recover incorrectly.
There *should* be a man page for recover, usually recover.6 or
recover.txt in your distribution. You have to be in the shell, in the
lib directory (where all the special level files and the nethack
executable are) and run it there as either root or games. The resulting
file in the save directory has to be uid games, so if you do it as root,
change it before you run nethack. 


